/generated_imgs/

# Private planning / competitive strategy — local only, never public
planning/

# Private data store — local only, never public. Holds the traffic dataset
# (TomTom-derived: raw flow samples plus every layer built from them), which
# left this repo on 2026-08-13 because TomTom's terms do not cover storing or
# republishing Results and data/ here is offered under CC BY 4.0. The workflow
# mounts a private checkout at this path; see scripts/traffic_paths.py and the
# "TomTom storage exposure" entry in CHECKLIST.md.
/private-data/
# Belt and braces: daily_compare.yml commits with a broad `git add data/`, so
# if anything ever recreated data/traffic/ it would be republished here. This
# line makes that impossible without a deliberate `git add -f`.
/data/traffic/

# Keystatic local-mode cache (dev only; never committed)
.keystatic/
